# Code quality

- Prefer a small change that improves health over a large dump that only "works".
- Put new behavior in `app/lib/features/` or `app/lib/core/`. Do not grow `main.dart`.
- Prove behavior with a failing test before the fix. Untested branches do not ship.
- Missing data stays missing. Never fall back to an unrelated seed or sample document.
- No busy-wait loops. Wait on a ready future, listener, or provider.
- UI copy goes through l10n. Book titles and file contents stay as-is.
- Swallowing errors needs a reason. Empty `catch` is not a reason.
